fix_code_raw_response:
The issue in the code is that the counter `cnt` is not incremented when the last group is guided to the attraction. This is because the condition to increment `cnt` is only checked when the number of people in the current group exceeds the number of empty seats. However, if the last group fits exactly or partially into the remaining seats, the attraction is not started one last time.

To fix this, we need to ensure that the attraction is started one final time if there are any remaining groups after the loop ends.

